- **What changed and why:** Added `backend/app/research/data_quality.py` with a frozen `Finding` dataclass and 10 pure checks plus `run_all`, `sha256_of_file`, and `build_manifest`. Added synthetic deterministic tests in `backend/tests/test_research_data_quality.py`. Updated CI workflow pytest list to include the new test file. This provides the pure validation layer F2 will use on the frozen ETF snapshot; no I/O/network/randomness in checks, no existing module changed.
